><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/13a79b223f0f0a75ad9a41c89865512e.poster.avif?t=1754505414\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/13a79b223f0f0a75ad9a41c89865512e.webm?t=1754505414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/13a79b223f0f0a75ad9a41c89865512e.mp4?t=1754505414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/e8d877d796532ef89835f881b1439e97.avif?t=1754505414\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/228cbc1453ab85d0e8b2870264a3a233.poster.avif?t=1754505414\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/228cbc1453ab85d0e8b2870264a3a233.webm?t=1754505414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/228cbc1453ab85d0e8b2870264a3a233.mp4?t=1754505414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bushcraft Survival is a passion project made by a solo developer from a small province in Canada called Newfoundland. Growing up building simple log cabins in the woods, sitting by the fire and staring up at the night sky full of stars, and tagging along hunting expeditions have all been core ingredients for the makeup of this game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529110/extras/4a7caf6da469640a9e1a7d4122cfb34c.avif?t=1754505414\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the discord</strong>, and feel free to ask any questions about the game or its development under BUSHCRAFT-SURVIVAL in #chat!</p>",
